@startuml
title Artillery exact probability state machine across bounded bombardments
hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor #424242
}

[*] --> Initialize : ArtilleryCommand validated
Initialize : Distribution = {input state: 1.0}
Initialize --> Bombardment : Shooting #1

state "Bombardment transition" as Bombardment {
  state "Resolve covered Team groups" as Teams
  state "Update Unit state" as PinAndState
  Teams : Exact hit probability per Team
  Teams : • miss → survives, no hit
  Teams : • hit + successful survival → survives, hit
  Teams : • hit + failed survival → destroyed, hit
  Teams --> PinAndState : merge equivalent survivor/hit states
  PinAndState : covered IC/OOC survivor counts
  PinAndState : Unit Leader alive; prior losses
  PinAndState : pin = prior pin OR hits reach policy threshold
  PinAndState --> [*]
}

Bombardment --> Report : one ShootingResult summary
Report : expected survivors; Not In Good Spirits
Report : Unit/Formation destruction; pinned chance
Report : remaining-Team-count distribution
Report --> Stop : horizon reached
Report --> StartingStep : more shootings remain
Report --> TerminalUnitDestroyed : no surviving target Teams

state "Between-turn Starting Step" as StartingStep {
  state "Rally" as Rally
  state "Unit Good Spirits / Last Stand" as LastStand
  state "Formation Last Stand" as Formation
  [*] --> Rally
  Rally : if pinned, Rally success clears pin
  Rally : failed Rally preserves pin
  Rally : Command Leadership may reroll failure
  LastStand : apply V4 Unit criteria to survivors
  LastStand : if not In Good Spirits, roll rating
  LastStand : eligible Command Leadership rerolls failure
  Rally --> LastStand
  LastStand --> Formation
  Formation : if modeled, count target + fixed other extant Units
  Formation : fewer than 2 → Formation destroyed
  Formation --> [*]
}

StartingStep --> TerminalUnitDestroyed : Unit destroyed by Last Stand
StartingStep --> TerminalFormationDestroyed : Formation destroyed
StartingStep --> Bombardment : next attack is Repeat Bombardment
TerminalUnitDestroyed --> Stop
TerminalFormationDestroyed --> Stop
Stop --> [*]
TerminalUnitDestroyed : absorbing state through remaining requested rows
TerminalFormationDestroyed : absorbing state through remaining requested rows

note right of Bombardment
For later shootings, To Hit is first attempt
when the Spotter can see the aiming point;
otherwise the Repeat +1 applies. Successful
Infantry saves are re-rolled on a Repeat.
end note

note bottom of StartingStep
Repeat eligibility and other roster/In-Command states
are held as user-confirmed horizon assumptions.
Time on Target plus Repeat is rejected as unresolved.
end note
@enduml
